---
layout: "base.njk"
permalink: "about/sources/index.html"
title: "Sources · Type 1, explained"
description: "The published guidance the facts on this site were checked against."
section: "about"
css: ["article.css"]
---
{% include "header.njk" %}
<div class="wrap">

  <main>
    <h1>Sources</h1>
    <p class="lede">The facts on this site were last checked against these pages in {{ sources.lastChecked }}.</p>
    <p>Advice differs a little between countries, so follow your own care team where it does. The site has not been reviewed by a medical professional; see the <a href="{{ '/about/disclaimer/' | url }}">disclaimer</a>.</p>

    {%- for group in sources.groups %}
    <h2>{{ group.title }}</h2>
    <ul>
      {%- for item in group.items %}
      <li><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.title }}</a>, {{ item.by }}{% if item.note %} ({{ item.note }}){% endif %}</li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- endfor %}
  </main>

  {% include "footer.njk" %}
</div>
